{"id":"n72159-1-8","stage":1,"title":"침실 · 卧室","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72159-1-8-1","ko":"대체 왜 이 서류가 침실에 있었던 거지?","zh":"这文件到底为什么会出现在卧室里啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대체","meaning":"到底、究竟","explanation":"대체：到底、究竟","readings":[{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:대체:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"대체","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서류가","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"침실에","meaning":"卧室","explanation":"침실：卧室；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"침실","audio":"/audio/d00abe5b484e8ee7bdc8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72159","senseId":"1","lemma":"침실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었던","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"baa66ff689021a3f","term":"대체","zh":"到底、究竟","audio":